WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:16.169
Daisy: Jenna, it's finally here!

2
00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:20.477
Jenna: Yay! Look, Daisy, I got a new backpack.

3
00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:23.953
Daisy: Cool. I'm using my sister's old one.

4
00:00:23.954 --> 00:00:25.379
Daisy: But that's okay.

5
00:00:25.379 --> 00:00:27.468
I like frogs.

6
00:00:27.469 --> 00:00:31.677
Jenna: I can't wait to go back to South Street School.

7
00:00:31.678 --> 00:00:34.511
Jenna: And meet our teacher, Miss Gray.

8
00:00:34.512 --> 00:00:36.650
Jenna: It's such a nice name.

9
00:00:36.651 --> 00:00:45.451
Jenna: It rhymes with day, play, May . . . all great words!

10
00:00:45.452 --> 00:00:50.891
Daisy: My sister said Miss Gray is really nice—and really pretty.

11
00:00:50.892 --> 00:00:54.216
Jenna: I bet she lets us sit next to each other!

12
00:00:54.217 --> 00:01:02.923
Jenna: Come on! Let's run!

13
00:01:02.924 --> 00:01:06.529
Mark: Ugh! It's the first day of school, Coby!

14
00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:09.050
Coby: Don't remind me.

15
00:01:09.051 --> 00:01:10.892
Mark: What's our teacher's name?

16
00:01:10.892 --> 00:01:12.418
I keep forgetting.

17
00:01:12.419 --> 00:01:14.676
Coby: And I keep telling you, Mark!

18
00:01:14.676 --> 00:01:17.353
It's Miss Gray.

19
00:01:17.354 --> 00:01:22.672
Mark: Oh, right. Gray, like a gloomy rain cloud.

20
00:01:22.673 --> 00:01:25.673
Coby: Or a big, creepy spider!

21
00:01:25.674 --> 00:01:38.734
Mark: Yuck! Second grade is going to be awful!

22
00:01:38.735 --> 00:01:41.472
Coby: So who's your teacher, Jenna?

23
00:01:41.473 --> 00:01:43.465
Jenna: Miss Gray.

24
00:01:43.466 --> 00:01:46.735
Daisy: She's really nice and really pretty.

25
00:01:46.736 --> 00:01:48.715
Mark: That's not what we heard.

26
00:01:48.716 --> 00:01:50.788
Mark: We heard she’s strange.

27
00:01:50.789 --> 00:01:54.012
Coby: Yep. And she looks like an alien to me.

28
00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:56.171
Jenna: What?

29
00:01:56.172 --> 00:01:59.415
Mr. Joe: Welcome back, everyone.

30
00:01:59.416 --> 00:02:04.345
Mr. Joe: It's time to line up with your class.

31
00:02:04.346 --> 00:02:07.412
Daisy: You two are lying.

32
00:02:07.413 --> 00:02:10.510
Mark: Nope. We only tell the truth.

33
00:02:10.511 --> 00:02:15.418
Jenna: Really? She looks like an alien?

34
00:02:15.419 --> 00:02:17.602
Mr. Joe: Make a straight line, kids.

35
00:02:17.603 --> 00:02:21.679
Mr. Joe: Here comes your teacher!

36
00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:26.296
Kids: Huh?
